# Expo artefacts that Expo CLI sometimes drops at the workspace root instead of apps/driver/.
# The real native projects live in apps/driver/ios and apps/driver/android.
# Committing these would install a second "FuelGuard" app (com.anonymous.*) alongside the real one.
/ios/
/android/
/app.json
/.expo/
/tsconfig.json
*.removed

